WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:16.803
"What do you mean?" Zann asked Fala. "What's happening?"

2
00:00:16.804 --> 00:00:21.531
"Early this morning a group of people marched on the palace," Fala replied.

3
00:00:21.532 --> 00:00:25.136
"What people?" Perda asked. "The Reds we freed?"

4
00:00:25.137 --> 00:00:28.146
"A few of them were there." Fala started pacing.

5
00:00:28.147 --> 00:00:30.867
"But the marchers were mostly non-Reds.

6
00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:35.561
They demanded that Morb leave and return the rightful king and queen."

7
00:00:35.562 --> 00:00:38.385
"What did Morb do?" Darb asked.

8
00:00:38.386 --> 00:00:43.219
Fala grimaced. "He had his trolls throw the leaders into the river.

9
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:48.930
Then he stopped the rest of the marchers by turning the cobblestones in the courtyard into burning coals."

10
00:00:48.931 --> 00:00:53.554
"Ouch!" Zann winced, imagining the burn on his feet.

11
00:00:53.555 --> 00:00:56.899
"That put an end to the rebellion," said Fala.

12
00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.005
"Most citizens are staying home now and waiting to see what will happen next."

13
00:01:01.006 --> 00:01:07.020
She sighed. "It's been a long time since anyone in Magica had to worry about this sort of thing."

14
00:01:07.021 --> 00:01:12.148
"Everyone is probably waiting for the Red Council to rescue them," Gliss commented.

15
00:01:12.149 --> 00:01:18.354
"Too bad most of the Red Council is in Morb's dungeon somewhere on Mount Mystery," Perda said.

16
00:01:18.355 --> 00:01:24.265
"Morb announced that all Voids are invited to accept jobs as palace servants," Fala went on.

17
00:01:24.266 --> 00:01:30.037
"They'll be rewarded with amulets to provide them with enough magic to perform most daily tasks."

18
00:01:30.038 --> 00:01:35.184
"That at least doesn't sound too bad," Gliss said, shooting a look at Darb.

19
00:01:35.185 --> 00:01:42.198
"That's not all," Fala said. "Morb ordered all remaining free Reds to report to the palace immediately.

20
00:01:42.199 --> 00:01:45.965
Then he warned that more changes will be coming soon."

21
00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:50.420
"Like that horrible new machine Gliss told us about?" Perda wondered.

22
00:01:50.421 --> 00:01:54.895
"Perhaps," said Fala. "In any case, there's no time to waste.

23
00:01:54.896 --> 00:01:58.846
If we don't act now, Magica could be lost forever."

24
00:01:58.847 --> 00:02:01.733
"Then let's do something!" Zann exclaimed.

25
00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:05.164
"Should we go back to the palace and try to fight Morb?"

26
00:02:05.165 --> 00:02:09.827
"No," Fala replied. "I have a better idea."

27
00:02:09.828 --> 00:02:11.536
Zap!

28
00:02:11.537 --> 00:02:15.401
"Wow," Zann said. "You really did it!"

29
00:02:15.402 --> 00:02:21.827
Fala nodded, looking tired. She'd zapped them all from the safe house to the woods outside the city.

30
00:02:21.828 --> 00:02:28.597
Zann was impressed. He'd zapped himself and Darb often enough to know that it took more energy to zap two people than one.

31
00:02:28.598 --> 00:02:34.356
He'd never tried zapping five people and a dragon before—especially such a long distance.

32
00:02:34.357 --> 00:02:38.852
Despite not being a Red, Fala's magic was very strong.

33
00:02:38.853 --> 00:02:43.041
"Is this the right spot?" she asked once she'd caught her breath.

34
00:02:43.042 --> 00:02:50.957
"Yes," Darb said. He led the others along a trail to the large clearing, where the two cloud gliders were grazing peacefully.

35
00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:55.416
Fala stepped toward the dragons. "Nice beasts," she said approvingly.

36
00:02:55.417 --> 00:02:57.695
"I learned to ride on a cloud glider."

37
00:02:57.696 --> 00:03:01.430
"You know how to ride dragons?" Perda asked.

38
00:03:01.431 --> 00:03:05.292
"Sure." Fala stepped toward the larger dragon and gave it a pat.

39
00:03:05.293 --> 00:03:08.668
"I'll steer this fellow if one of you wants to take the other."

40
00:03:08.669 --> 00:03:13.032
"I'll do it," Darb volunteered. "Gliss, want to ride with me again?"

41
00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:17.874
"Sure," Gliss said. "Perda can join us, and Zann can go with Fala."

42
00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:22.314
Zann was a little disappointed that he and Perda wouldn't be riding together.

43
00:03:22.315 --> 00:03:26.831
But it was too late to say anything—everyone was already climbing onto the dragons.

44
00:03:26.832 --> 00:03:31.004
Fala's plan was to ride the dragons to Morb's fortress on Mount Mystery.

45
00:03:31.005 --> 00:03:36.803
There they would sneak in and free all the Red prisoners while Morb was busy at the palace.

46
00:03:36.804 --> 00:03:40.551
"Follow us, Zing," Zann called as the dragons took off.

47
00:03:40.552 --> 00:03:44.442
"Hold on tightly," Fala told Zann over her shoulder.

48
00:03:44.443 --> 00:03:48.110
"I want to get high up in the sky before we cross over the city."

49
00:03:48.111 --> 00:03:52.316
Zann grabbed her around the waist as their dragon flew higher and higher.

50
00:03:52.317 --> 00:03:54.786
He could hear Zing whistling behind them.

51
00:03:54.787 --> 00:04:00.047
Soon both cloud gliders and Zing were soaring high over First City.

52
00:04:00.048 --> 00:04:04.954
Zann peered down and spotted the palace almost directly below them.

53
00:04:04.955 --> 00:04:10.043
"How long will it take to reach Mount Mystery?" Perda called over to Fala.

54
00:04:10.044 --> 00:04:14.102
"Probably three or four hours," Fala replied. "We—"

55
00:04:14.103 --> 00:04:17.188
She was interrupted by a terrifying scream.

56
00:04:17.189 --> 00:04:22.419
An enormous purple dragon burst through a cloud and headed straight toward them.

57
00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:26.842
"Look out!" Darb yelled. "It's a thunder charger!"

58
00:04:26.843 --> 00:04:32.429
Fala gasped. "I think that's one of the wild dragons that disappeared from the zoo!" she cried.

59
00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:36.287
"Morb must be using them to guard the air above the palace!"

60
00:04:36.288 --> 00:04:44.581
"There's another one!" Zann exclaimed as a sleek green-and-orange beast appeared, followed by three more scary-looking dragons.

61
00:04:44.582 --> 00:04:50.638
The cloud gliders snorted with terror, doing their best to dodge the attacking wild dragons.

62
00:04:50.639 --> 00:04:55.538
"Hang on!" Fala yelled to Zann as their dragon swooped downward.

63
00:04:55.539 --> 00:05:03.959
Zann tried not to let go. He glanced over and saw the girls clinging to Darb, who was steering the other cloud glider through the attack.

64
00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:09.071
Then Zann looked down. The city looked much closer now, especially the palace.

65
00:05:09.072 --> 00:05:16.765
Zann nearly lost his grip as his dragon dived downward again, barely escaping the thunder charger's electrical bolt.

66
00:05:16.766 --> 00:05:21.425
Nearby Zing was weaving back and forth to avoid the bigger dragons.

67
00:05:21.426 --> 00:05:25.136
Another bolt of electricity singed the tip of Zing's wing.

68
00:05:25.137 --> 00:05:29.999
The small dragon let out a squeal of pain and attempted to fly to Zann.

69
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.745
"Come on, Zing! You can make it!" cried Zann.

70
00:05:33.746 --> 00:05:38.809
Zing flew as fast as he could, desperately trying to keep up with the cloud glider.

71
00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:42.387
Once Zing was close enough, Zann put out a hand for him.

72
00:05:42.388 --> 00:05:46.834
At that exact same moment, Fala changed directions again.

73
00:05:46.835 --> 00:05:52.127
Zing quickly leaped onto the cloud glider's back, but Zann was thrown off-balance.

74
00:05:52.128 --> 00:05:59.560
He reached for Fala, but the cloud glider lurched forward to avoid another attack and Zann's hand swiped nothing but air.

75
00:05:59.561 --> 00:06:02.136
Zann called out. "Help!"

76
00:06:02.137 --> 00:06:08.624
By the time Fala realized what had happened, Zann was already plummeting toward the palace far below.

77
00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:14.767
"Zann!" screamed Fala.
